WEBVTT

00:43.544 --> 00:45.254
Do you love jjajangmyeon that much?

00:45.337 --> 00:46.672
CHAPTER 36:
WHO THE HELL ARE YOU?

00:46.756 --> 00:48.466
Look at you, stuffing your face.

00:48.549 --> 00:49.592
Is it that good?

00:55.556 --> 00:56.724
Mr. Ga!

00:57.558 --> 00:58.684
Are you okay?

00:58.768 --> 01:00.394
Oh, no. I'm sorry.

01:00.478 --> 01:01.562
Are you okay?

01:01.645 --> 01:02.688
Oh, no.

01:05.608 --> 01:07.860
Who are these heavenly figures?

01:08.986 --> 01:10.863
What leads you to descend from on high

01:10.946 --> 01:12.615
to visit my humble place?

01:13.199 --> 01:14.158
Was it you bastards

01:15.659 --> 01:16.660
who put him in that state?

01:18.537 --> 01:19.705
Oh, no…

01:19.789 --> 01:21.290
This is hilarious.

01:21.791 --> 01:23.501
We've got guests here.

01:23.584 --> 01:25.461
Go get them a welcome drink.

01:25.544 --> 01:28.047
Don't just sit around watching.

01:28.881 --> 01:30.633
-Get some tea.
-Keep an eye on the kids.

01:31.467 --> 01:32.551
We can do that.

01:34.929 --> 01:35.763
You got this.

01:37.681 --> 01:38.724
Are you hurt?

01:42.019 --> 01:44.188
-But…
-Don't worry, he'll be fine.

01:44.980 --> 01:46.649
Is picking on kids…

01:49.109 --> 01:50.319
your idea of fun?

01:58.494 --> 02:01.247
What's with these assholes?

02:04.083 --> 02:05.543
-What on earth?
-Hey.

02:12.925 --> 02:13.884
Hey, kid!

02:17.888 --> 02:19.098
Are you crazy?

02:20.307 --> 02:21.308
Get him!

02:30.651 --> 02:31.652
That's how you do it!

02:33.320 --> 02:34.572
Why, you…

02:39.451 --> 02:40.536
What are you playing at?

02:43.747 --> 02:45.416
Are you okay? I guess you are.

02:58.053 --> 03:00.097
-Come at me.
-Hey.

03:00.180 --> 03:03.183
Look, should a teacher
be behaving this way?

03:03.267 --> 03:04.476
-He has a knife!
-A teacher…

03:22.620 --> 03:24.204
Who the hell

03:24.955 --> 03:26.624
are you, bastard?

03:27.499 --> 03:29.793
Me? I'm a Korean literature teacher.

03:31.170 --> 03:34.006
All right, Korean literature teacher.

03:54.610 --> 03:55.611
No, don't look.

03:59.114 --> 04:00.950
Let's go.

04:05.037 --> 04:07.581
EPISODE 12

04:08.666 --> 04:10.167
How are you going to resolve this?

04:10.793 --> 04:12.461
We'll pretend it never happened.

04:13.379 --> 04:14.630
Apologize to the students.

04:17.675 --> 04:18.676
-I'm sorry.
-I'm sorry.

04:20.511 --> 04:22.346
Are you going to show up again?

04:22.972 --> 04:24.056
-No.
-No.

04:26.809 --> 04:28.227
If I ever see you again,

04:28.978 --> 04:30.813
you're going down for real then.

04:33.148 --> 04:35.567
An esteemed shaman told me

04:35.651 --> 04:37.361
I'd live a long and healthy life.

04:43.283 --> 04:44.576
Goodbye, Mr. Teacher.

04:45.160 --> 04:46.161
No, boss.

04:46.245 --> 04:47.329
I mean, boss teacher.

04:49.331 --> 04:50.457
Okay. Let's go.

04:52.960 --> 04:53.961
Let's go.

05:04.346 --> 05:07.766
What the fuck? What's up with that prick?

05:08.392 --> 05:10.436
Didn't he say
he was a Korean literature teacher?

05:10.519 --> 05:12.146
How can a teacher fight like that?

05:13.147 --> 05:15.024
He was being deadly serious

05:15.649 --> 05:18.277
when he said he'd kill us
if he ever saw us again.

05:20.404 --> 05:23.407
The look in his eyes was murderous.

05:23.991 --> 05:25.367
What the heck? Who are they?

05:25.451 --> 05:26.660
What if they kidnapped her?

05:26.744 --> 05:28.370
Ji-a lives at the shelter
and works part-time.

05:28.454 --> 05:29.371
What staff?

05:29.913 --> 05:30.831
Your call cannot be…

05:30.914 --> 05:32.166
Why isn't she answering?

05:32.249 --> 05:33.333
CHAPTER 37:
UNMASKED FOR JUSTICE

05:33.417 --> 05:35.127
Why isn't she even checking?

06:18.962 --> 06:21.673
You scared me to death. I was so worried!

06:22.466 --> 06:24.551
The news about Ji-a alone
was terrifying enough,

06:24.635 --> 06:26.178
and I couldn't get hold of you.

06:26.261 --> 06:30.432
My imagination started to run wild,
thinking you'd gotten caught up in it too.

06:34.103 --> 06:36.522
You weren't answering your phone
or checking your messages.

06:38.982 --> 06:40.943
Nobody had any idea where you'd gone.

06:41.026 --> 06:42.778
Do you know how scared I was?

06:46.615 --> 06:48.325
I have a crush on Mr. Ga.

06:54.665 --> 06:55.791
What?

06:57.626 --> 07:01.338
I should've just told you
I have a crush on him,

07:02.422 --> 07:04.049
but I couldn't do it.

07:04.967 --> 07:08.470
I thought you might not understand
after the way we mocked him,

07:08.554 --> 07:10.472
and I wasn't sure exactly how I felt.

07:11.306 --> 07:12.558
So I was flustered.

07:13.600 --> 07:14.434
That's why

07:15.185 --> 07:16.562
I ended up hurting you.

07:17.729 --> 07:18.689
I'm sorry.

07:24.027 --> 07:27.281
I was hurt because it seemed like
you were keeping a secret from me.

07:28.657 --> 07:30.617
I didn't care if you liked Dong-ju too.

07:31.660 --> 07:34.788
But I was sad that you couldn't
bring yourself to tell me.

07:38.375 --> 07:40.919
You always tell me everything.

07:42.629 --> 07:45.632
I was the first person you told
about your constipation.

07:52.097 --> 07:54.474
You're my top priority.
You know that, right?

08:00.063 --> 08:00.898
Hey.

08:01.690 --> 08:05.652
If Dong-ju and I both fall into a lake,
who are you going to save first?

08:08.322 --> 08:10.449
You used to compete in toddler swim meets.

08:13.869 --> 08:14.745
Seriously?

08:17.664 --> 08:19.583
So, did something happen?

08:23.212 --> 08:25.672
Even if I tell you,
you're never gonna believe it.

08:25.756 --> 08:26.882
What?

08:26.965 --> 08:27.966
Come on, tell me.

08:29.259 --> 08:31.678
At first, the gangsters

08:31.762 --> 08:33.639
totally looked down on Mr. Yoon.

08:34.223 --> 08:36.892
Like, "What? Who does he think he is?"

08:36.975 --> 08:37.935
And then?

08:38.018 --> 08:41.730
Then, he addressed them in an icy tone.

08:41.813 --> 08:44.691
Not the soft voice
he normally uses when he talks to us.

08:44.775 --> 08:46.026
Just really serious.

08:47.819 --> 08:49.821
"Is picking on kids your idea of fun?"

08:49.905 --> 08:51.198
He said it just like that.

08:51.281 --> 08:53.700
I got goose bumps just hearing it.

08:53.784 --> 08:58.372
Then, it was just a whirl of front kicks,
back kicks, and flying kicks.

08:58.455 --> 09:00.249
He even grabbed them by the collar

09:00.332 --> 09:02.501
and punched them.

09:02.584 --> 09:04.461
It was just like a movie.

09:04.544 --> 09:05.754
And after that,

09:06.380 --> 09:09.258
his shirt sleeve got torn.

09:09.341 --> 09:10.342
Torn?

09:10.425 --> 09:12.970
He had a huge tattoo.
You know Medusa, right?

09:13.053 --> 09:15.097
He has one here

09:15.180 --> 09:18.475
with several dragon-like creatures

09:18.558 --> 09:20.686
coiling and writhing all over.

09:20.769 --> 09:21.979
It's absolutely huge.

09:23.272 --> 09:24.273
Dong-ju…

09:26.984 --> 09:28.277
has a tattoo?

09:29.278 --> 09:30.112
Yeah.

09:30.737 --> 09:33.615
It was quite faded,
so I guess he's had it for a long time,

09:34.241 --> 09:35.701
but it looked like a Medusa for sure.

09:37.744 --> 09:41.748
It looked like it covered his shoulder
and continued on to his back,

09:41.832 --> 09:43.208
but I didn't actually see his back.

09:43.792 --> 09:44.626
Then,

09:45.585 --> 09:46.712
Dong-ju was…

09:48.880 --> 09:50.340
I think

09:50.966 --> 09:52.509
he used to be a gangster himself.

10:02.519 --> 10:03.770
Are you okay?

10:07.357 --> 10:08.400
Dong-ju

10:09.318 --> 10:10.736
used to be a gangster?

10:20.120 --> 10:21.580
Maybe I shouldn't have said anything.

10:22.622 --> 10:23.582
No! Just a moment.

10:23.665 --> 10:24.791
I haven't even touched you.

10:25.709 --> 10:27.169
Hang on a second.

10:27.252 --> 10:28.170
-Ready?
-I…

10:29.087 --> 10:30.380
-Stop moving.
-Do his lips too.

10:30.464 --> 10:31.631
Stay still!

10:31.715 --> 10:33.550
-Stop it. That hurts.
-All done.

10:34.051 --> 10:35.677
-We'll put the Band-Aid on later.
-It hurts.

10:35.761 --> 10:38.221
Jeez, he's going to
give me a breakdown at this rate.

10:38.305 --> 10:39.639
Let's see your hand.

10:39.723 --> 10:42.476
Your hand is a mess.
What are you going to do about it?

10:43.643 --> 10:44.895
At least your left hand is okay.

10:50.817 --> 10:51.818
How are you holding up?

10:54.404 --> 10:55.947
I swore I would never fight again.

10:59.493 --> 11:00.702
But look what happened.

11:03.538 --> 11:05.082
And in front of students too.

11:06.249 --> 11:07.834
It couldn't be helped.

11:09.294 --> 11:11.213
They even saw my tattoo.

11:14.132 --> 11:15.967
What am I going to do now?

11:29.815 --> 11:31.066
Do you remember?

11:33.693 --> 11:35.195
Back when I was in 11th grade,

11:35.278 --> 11:37.614
you got in a motorcycle accident
and passed out.

11:37.697 --> 11:38.865
I dragged you to the hospital,

11:39.449 --> 11:40.575
but as soon as you came to,

11:40.659 --> 11:43.453
you swung your fist at me,
yelling, "Was it you?"

11:43.537 --> 11:44.413
Damn it.

11:45.580 --> 11:47.666
I thought you were the one who hit me.

11:49.084 --> 11:50.794
You even bought me rice porridge.

11:51.878 --> 11:53.171
It was so weird.

11:53.964 --> 11:57.050
I was wondering why you bought it
after I beat you up for no reason.

11:57.717 --> 11:59.010
It was the middle of winter.

11:59.511 --> 12:01.596
And you were only wearing slides.

12:01.680 --> 12:03.515
You looked younger than me,

12:03.598 --> 12:06.017
and I just assumed you were struggling
at your part-time job.

12:07.811 --> 12:10.480
You were the first to be kind to me
without expecting anything in return.

12:11.773 --> 12:12.983
So I felt embarrassed.

12:15.527 --> 12:18.989
I thought if I carried on down that path,
I'd end up doing something really bad.

12:19.906 --> 12:22.242
I wondered if I could become like you.

12:25.078 --> 12:26.621
If I hadn't met you,

12:27.247 --> 12:28.832
I'd still be living that kind of life.

12:32.878 --> 12:33.879
At the time,

12:35.130 --> 12:37.048
I thought you were a freak.

12:40.218 --> 12:41.970
But for some reason,
I felt I'd run into you again.

12:42.762 --> 12:43.638
Why?

12:43.722 --> 12:44.723
I don't know.

12:46.892 --> 12:47.726
No idea.

12:50.812 --> 12:52.314
When I went to our college orientation,

12:53.106 --> 12:55.025
who should I see but this round face?

12:55.901 --> 12:57.611
I was actually quite pleased to see you.

12:57.694 --> 12:58.862
Weren't you?

13:01.364 --> 13:02.199
You know.

13:02.866 --> 13:04.326
This guy looked kind of dumb.

13:04.409 --> 13:05.994
-Screw you.
-I bet he did.

13:06.077 --> 13:08.205
-He still does.
-Whatever, you idiots.

13:10.749 --> 13:13.251
Why distinguish the guy you're now
from the one you were back then?

13:14.336 --> 13:16.129
They're both still you.

13:18.798 --> 13:20.467
You just have to accept it and move on.

13:24.971 --> 13:27.516
But Dong-ju is no ordinary dude.

13:28.141 --> 13:30.685
Setting his mind to studying
and going from a street thug

13:30.769 --> 13:33.146
to an education student at our college
in just two years?

13:33.230 --> 13:34.606
-How is that possible?
-It isn't.

13:34.689 --> 13:35.524
Exactly.

13:36.107 --> 13:37.359
He had it in him all along,

13:38.318 --> 13:40.070
but the circumstances
weren't right for him.

13:40.987 --> 13:43.615
And by the way…

13:43.698 --> 13:46.409
When was the last time
we saw Dong-ju show off his skills?

13:46.493 --> 13:48.119
-When was it?
-At that convenience store.

13:48.203 --> 13:49.246
Right!

13:50.080 --> 13:51.289
It's the first time since then, no?

13:51.873 --> 13:53.416
-Why won't you let it go?
-That store.

13:53.500 --> 13:55.168
We were all complete zombies,

13:55.252 --> 13:58.880
dragging our feet to the convenience store
to pick up some cup ramyeon.

13:58.964 --> 14:02.259
Some thugs were harassing the girl
working at the cash register.

14:13.520 --> 14:15.105
Is picking on kids

14:16.439 --> 14:17.399
your idea of fun?

14:21.027 --> 14:23.488
Me? I'm a Korean literature teacher.

14:28.535 --> 14:31.371
I can't believe
Mr. Yoon had a secret like that.

14:32.247 --> 14:34.666
Most of the time,
he hides his real identity.

14:34.749 --> 14:36.376
But when someone needs protecting,

14:37.210 --> 14:38.295
he fights.

14:41.631 --> 14:44.134
Here it comes.
My next wave of inspiration.

14:46.845 --> 14:50.181
WE WERE FRIENDS, EPISODE 8

14:58.189 --> 15:00.400
Forget it. Where is that place anyway?

15:00.483 --> 15:02.027
The food there melts in your mouth.

15:09.159 --> 15:10.243
Let's just go.

15:14.873 --> 15:15.874
What do you want?

15:17.584 --> 15:19.961
Didn't anyone ever teach you

15:20.045 --> 15:23.381
that fists are for protecting people,
not harming them?

15:23.465 --> 15:25.675
I guess you're here to teach us, huh?

15:42.275 --> 15:43.568
If I ever see you again,

15:44.569 --> 15:46.154
you're going down for real then.

15:48.490 --> 15:49.866
Let's go.

15:50.950 --> 15:52.285
I could just…

15:53.328 --> 15:54.287
I was going to help you,

15:54.371 --> 15:56.331
but it looked like
you had it all under control.

16:00.168 --> 16:01.670
"If I ever see you again,

16:02.712 --> 16:04.756
you're going down for real then."

16:08.176 --> 16:09.177
So cool.

16:10.178 --> 16:12.722
He's so cool.

16:16.643 --> 16:20.522
CHAPTER 38:
SIR! I HAVE SOMETHING TO SAY!

16:32.909 --> 16:33.743
Hi.

16:45.547 --> 16:46.673
What's up with her?

16:46.756 --> 16:47.674
I don't know.

16:48.425 --> 16:49.384
She's scaring me.

16:57.267 --> 17:00.145
-Good morning.
-Good morning.

17:00.228 --> 17:02.397
-Mr. Ga, your face.
-What happened?

17:02.480 --> 17:03.606
-Are you okay?
-Sir!

17:03.690 --> 17:04.816
Were you in a fight?

17:04.899 --> 17:06.025
Mr. Ga!

17:06.109 --> 17:09.195
-Seriously, who did this to you?
-What happened?

17:09.279 --> 17:11.906
Were you in a fight?
What's wrong with your face?

17:11.990 --> 17:13.533
Sir.

17:13.616 --> 17:14.617
Quiet.

17:14.701 --> 17:15.744
Don't worry, I'm fine.

17:15.827 --> 17:17.245
-My gosh.
-You don't look okay.

17:17.328 --> 17:18.496
We'll start with roll call.

17:19.789 --> 17:21.458
-Jeon Ji-min.
-Here.

17:21.541 --> 17:22.625
-Oh Ji-ho.
-Here.

17:22.709 --> 17:24.043
It's worse than I imagined.

17:24.127 --> 17:25.044
-Kim Ga-yeong.
-Here.

17:25.128 --> 17:26.796
It's better than yesterday.

17:26.880 --> 17:28.173
Hey, you two.

17:28.757 --> 17:30.800
-Hong Su-min.
-I see you've made up.

17:30.884 --> 17:31.760
Jeon Chae-won.

17:32.594 --> 17:33.928
-When did we ever fight?
-Im Su-yeon.

17:37.348 --> 17:39.142
-Lee Eun-ji.
-Here.

17:39.225 --> 17:40.602
-Choi Hye-jeong.
-Here.

17:42.937 --> 17:45.023
Give it your all in class today.
Have a good one.

17:45.648 --> 17:47.525
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

17:52.864 --> 17:53.990
Mr. Ga!

17:59.996 --> 18:02.248
I'm really sorry. It's all my fault.

18:05.710 --> 18:06.628
Are you okay?

18:08.546 --> 18:09.380
Yes.

18:11.049 --> 18:12.926
That's all that matters.
Pay attention in class.

18:16.846 --> 18:17.680
Okay.

18:35.240 --> 18:36.324
Hello.

18:36.407 --> 18:37.325
-Hi.
-Hello.

18:47.752 --> 18:49.128
Are you okay?

18:50.255 --> 18:52.757
I've decided to think things over.

18:56.135 --> 19:00.598
You know, Mr. Yoon
isn't that kind of person anymore.

19:00.682 --> 19:04.227
I think he's a really great guy.

19:04.978 --> 19:07.105
Never mind.
It's not my place to say anything.

19:07.939 --> 19:09.649
If that's how you feel, that's that.

19:10.650 --> 19:13.027
If you've decided you no longer like him,

19:13.736 --> 19:14.696
that's fine.

19:16.197 --> 19:17.907
When did I say that?

19:20.118 --> 19:21.119
Isn't that what you mean?

19:22.912 --> 19:24.581
From now on, I'll be the one.

19:25.999 --> 19:29.127
No matter how fierce the storm gets,
I'll make sure he isn't knocked over

19:29.210 --> 19:30.628
or hurt in any way.

19:31.254 --> 19:32.422
I'll be the one to do it.

19:34.757 --> 19:35.592
Go-ya.

19:36.342 --> 19:38.386
So I need to get into a good college

19:38.469 --> 19:40.179
and make a success of myself,

19:40.263 --> 19:42.765
so that I can be someone
Dong-ju can trust and rely on.

19:44.350 --> 19:46.352
If I want to protect Dong-ju,

19:46.978 --> 19:48.271
I have to be able to do so.

19:50.273 --> 19:51.482
I've decided to take the CSAT.

19:52.025 --> 19:54.777
It'll give me more options
than just taking the practical exam.

19:57.071 --> 19:57.989
Now I finally get

19:58.990 --> 20:00.950
why I've been single my whole life.

20:01.784 --> 20:02.619
Huh?

20:02.702 --> 20:04.746
When I like someone,

20:05.496 --> 20:08.416
I just hope they'll like me as I am.

20:08.499 --> 20:10.627
Even if I don't do anything,

20:10.710 --> 20:13.796
I hope they'll fall for me
and be interested in me.

20:16.758 --> 20:19.844
I've only whined like a baby

20:20.845 --> 20:22.055
and gotten jealous so far.

20:22.764 --> 20:25.099
Now I see I have to become someone worthy.

20:30.021 --> 20:32.273
You're already worthy, my friend.

20:35.735 --> 20:36.569
Okay?

20:40.031 --> 20:41.616
What should I do?

20:48.414 --> 20:49.415
Tell him how you feel.

20:51.876 --> 20:53.419
You said he might be going to the US.

20:55.004 --> 20:56.464
-Tell him?
-Yeah.

20:58.925 --> 21:02.053
How would I go about doing that?

21:03.888 --> 21:05.807
First, look him in the eyes.

21:05.890 --> 21:07.350
For at least three seconds.

21:07.433 --> 21:09.102
To show him how serious you are,

21:10.269 --> 21:11.688
gaze into his eyes tenderly…

21:13.189 --> 21:14.482
and deeply like this.

21:19.612 --> 21:22.407
Hey, how am I supposed to do that?

21:23.282 --> 21:24.784
Do you want to tell him or not?

21:27.537 --> 21:28.705
I do.

21:28.788 --> 21:30.915
Then do as I say.
Look him in the eye for three seconds.

21:33.751 --> 21:35.169
Okay, I'll give it a try.

21:35.253 --> 21:36.754
Look him in the eye for three seconds,

21:36.838 --> 21:37.880
tell him you like him,

21:37.964 --> 21:39.507
and leave it at that.

21:42.427 --> 21:44.512
Even if he's not interested,
when he hears that,

21:44.595 --> 21:46.097
do you know what will happen?

21:47.598 --> 21:48.933
He'll

21:49.559 --> 21:50.685
waver.

21:51.269 --> 21:52.729
-Waver?
-Yeah.

21:52.812 --> 21:54.480
He'll waver. I guarantee it.

21:54.564 --> 21:55.982
That's just how guys are.

21:57.483 --> 22:00.778
With your first snow,
you have to just go for it.

22:02.030 --> 22:04.032
Okay, just go for it.

22:04.532 --> 22:07.452
Instead of waiting and agonizing,
just go for it, okay?

22:08.202 --> 22:11.164
Where's a good place to do it?

22:11.247 --> 22:13.082
You have after-school math later.
Just do it then.

22:14.292 --> 22:15.126
Today?

22:16.586 --> 22:17.545
Today…

22:19.297 --> 22:22.008
MURIM GIRLS' HIGH SCHOOL

22:22.675 --> 22:25.053
The graph of the function
will look like this.

22:25.803 --> 22:27.597
-What should I say?
-If the graph of y equals f(x)

22:27.680 --> 22:30.224
and the line y equals k

22:30.308 --> 22:32.143
-Sir, I…
-intersect at one positive

22:32.226 --> 22:34.604
and two negative x-coordinates,
the real value of k

22:34.687 --> 22:37.857
-will range from negative eight to zero.
-To tell the truth, I…

22:37.940 --> 22:40.651
Once you plot it on a graph,
it's easy to understand, right?

22:40.735 --> 22:42.487
Let's leave it here for today. Great job.

22:42.570 --> 22:43.738
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

22:43.821 --> 22:45.281
What?

22:45.364 --> 22:46.449
Class is over already?

22:51.370 --> 22:54.415
For now,
let's wait for the others to leave.

23:01.422 --> 23:02.298
Aren't you going?

23:04.300 --> 23:06.010
I'm just about to.

23:06.094 --> 23:07.053
Sir!

23:10.681 --> 23:12.433
This is it. It's now or never.

23:19.315 --> 23:20.399
Your glasses.

23:23.069 --> 23:24.570
You've got a new pair.

23:26.864 --> 23:28.950
No, I can't do it.

23:40.002 --> 23:41.462
Let's do it. You got this, Eui-ju!

23:41.546 --> 23:42.630
Mr. Ga…

23:48.553 --> 23:51.931
No, I've got to do it today.
Otherwise, I'll never do it.

24:03.151 --> 24:05.778
Mr. Ga! Wait a minute.

24:05.862 --> 24:07.613
Sir! I have something to say!

24:07.697 --> 24:08.823
Just a moment.

24:08.906 --> 24:10.074
Wait.

24:10.158 --> 24:11.784
Just a second.

24:15.997 --> 24:16.998
Just a moment.

24:22.962 --> 24:24.005
What is it?

24:41.063 --> 24:41.981
I…

25:06.339 --> 25:07.840
Eui-ju, come with me.

25:07.924 --> 25:08.966
Why is he so uptight?

25:09.050 --> 25:10.426
Isn't he just following the rules?

25:10.509 --> 25:12.178
That might actually be more fair.

25:12.261 --> 25:13.930
There's a web novel with main characters

25:14.013 --> 25:16.057
who are exactly like
the Korean literature, Math, PE,

25:16.140 --> 25:18.059
and Japanese teachers from our school.

25:18.142 --> 25:20.102
I'm really curious who wrote it.

25:20.186 --> 25:21.520
You're done for.

25:21.604 --> 25:23.022
I thought you should know, Mr. Ga.

25:23.105 --> 25:24.273
It was Eui-ju.

25:24.357 --> 25:25.191
What do you mean?

25:25.274 --> 25:26.192
Is it really you?

25:26.275 --> 25:27.109
To tell the truth…

25:27.193 --> 25:28.694
-The thing is, Go-ya--
-This is insane.

25:28.778 --> 25:30.279
I'll see that she's expelled.

25:30.363 --> 25:32.281
Just pretend you didn't know.

25:32.365 --> 25:34.367
I don't want you getting in trouble
because of me.

25:34.450 --> 25:37.286
Hello, this is Imuk.

26:33.592 --> 26:35.594
Subtitle: Paul Carver
